  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During the Gu Yue clan elders’ battle with the thunder crown wolf, three Gu Masters work together at close range. One turns into a white ape and another turns his muscles to steel from head to toe to curb the wolf. The third tosses out unending numbers of Puppet Gu, pours in primeval essence, and turns them into vine armoured grass soldiers or wooden servants with red spears, using them as fodder to attract the incoming assault.",
